//! The Matter cluster library, generated from the CSA data model.
//!
//! One module per cluster. Each holds the cluster's identifiers, its feature bits,
//! its enumerations and bitmaps as Rust types, and a [`Cluster`](crate::dm::spec::Cluster)
//! carrying every element the specification defines with its conformance, access and
//! qualities.
//!
//! These are the specification's tables, not a device's configuration. What a device
//! serves is a [`ClusterDescriptor`](crate::dm::ClusterDescriptor), and
//! [`Cluster::validate`](crate::dm::spec::Cluster::validate) is what checks one
//! against the other — the drift that certification finds, found at home instead.

